      "rationale": "[Literature audit 2026-11-05 (deliverome-analysis PR 236), verdict confirmed_exact: position confirmed at this residue. validation_level surface_only -> detected_only (paper reports surface: not_reported, function: not_reported). Paper (PMID 38891079): \"the HA-tag in human syndecan-4 was placed between amino acids 27 and 28 at the N-terminus\". Audit note: HA-SDC4 used for immunoprecipitation and fixed-cell immunofluorescence in H9c2 cells; no non-permeabilized/live surface staining is described, so surface_only validation is overstated.] L1 explicitly names the junction as between amino acids 27 and 28 of human SDC4. Position 27 (I) and 28 (D) are both within the extracellular domain (residues 19-149), 9 residues into the ectodomain from the signal peptide cleavage site, and 122 residues from the TM boundary\u2014well clear of all constraints. Python confirms residue_before=I, residue_after=D. Full-length human SDC4 construct with HA-tag inserted between amino acids 27 and 28, expressed in mammalian cells; the paper explicitly states the junction residues.",
